TrustTunnel VPN client (CLI).

C++/Rust client library + `trusttunnel_client` binary that connects to a
TrustTunnel endpoint. Supports system-wide TUN/Wintun tunnel and SOCKS5
proxy, split tunneling via domain/IP exclusion lists, and custom DNS
upstreams (DoH/DoT/DoQ).

Pair with `security/trusttunnel` for the server-side daemon.

WWW: https://github.com/TrustTunnel/TrustTunnelClient
